6, "ph": []}, "market-055": {"raw": "老闆，你是不是故意的啊？", "pos": 60584, "ph": []}, "market-056": {"raw": "好，謝謝。", "pos": 60646, "ph": []}, "market-057": {"raw": "數量不對：你買了${qZh(it, ck.q)}${it.zh}，老闆放了${qZh(it, ck.wq)}。拿東西以前，要先看一看。", "pos": 60851, "ph": [["qZh(it, ck.q)", "qZh(it, ck.q)"], ["菜名", "it.zh"], ["qZh(it, ck.wq)", "qZh(it, ck.wq)"]]}, "market-058": {"raw": "數量是對的：${it.zh}就是${qZh(it, ck.q)}。", "pos": 61185, "ph": [["菜名", "it.zh"], ["qZh(it, ck.q)", "qZh(it, ck.q)"]]}, "market-059": {"raw": "要有禮貌，說清楚你要的數量就好。", "pos": 61328, "ph": []}, "market-060": {"raw": "（手機響了一聲，是Ami傳來的LINE。）", "pos": 62221, "ph": []}, "market-061": {"raw": "Ami，${labZh(I.a, I.a.q)}我已經買了欸！", "pos": 62471, "ph": [["labZh(I.a, I.a.q)", "labZh(I.a, I.a.q)"]]}, "market-062": {"raw": "好，我再去買${labZh(I.y, I.y.q)}。", "pos": 62506, "ph": [["labZh(I.y, I.y.q)", "labZh(I.y, I.y.q)"]]}, "market-063": {"raw": "Ami，你自己來買吧！", "pos": 62537, "ph": []}, "market-064": {"raw": "Ami，${labZh(I.a, I.a.q)}我已經買了欸！", "pos": 62630, "ph": [["labZh(I.a, I.a.q)", "labZh(I.a, I.a.q)"]]}, "market-065": {"raw": "${I.a.zh}已經買好了，要告訴Ami。", "pos": 62913, "ph": [["I.a.zh", "I.a.zh"]]}, "market-066": {"raw": "很好！已經買了的東西，要馬上告訴Ami。", "pos": 63136, "ph": []}, "market-067": {"raw": "Ami：啊，你已經買了喔？那就不用改了，謝謝！", "pos": 63318, "ph": []}, "market-068": {"raw": "Ami：謝謝你！", "pos": 63540, "ph": []}, "market-069": {"raw": "（你提著環保袋回到Ami家，把菜拿給Ami。）", "pos": 63893, "ph": []}, "market-070": {"raw": "Ami：咦，${labZh(it, a.q)}呢？怎麼沒買？", "pos": 64108, "ph": [["labZh(it, a.q)", "labZh(it, a.q)"]]}, "market-071": {"raw": "不是錢不夠，是老闆生氣不賣給你。", "pos": 64691, "ph": []}, "market-072": {"raw": "你的錢是夠的，你是忘記買了。", "pos": 64860, "ph": []}, "market-073": {"raw": "老闆沒有不賣，是你的錢不夠。", "pos": 65035, "ph": []}, "market-074": {"raw": "老闆沒有不賣，你是忘記買了。", "pos": 65201, "ph": []}, "market-075": {"raw": "你不是忘記，是錢不夠，要說清楚。", "pos": 65370, "ph": []}, "market-076": {"raw": "你不是忘記，是老闆不賣給你。", "pos": 65526, "ph": []}, "market-077": {"raw": "Ami：可是你的錢是夠的啊！", "pos": 65755, "ph": []}}